<br />
ek satai hui bachi ko sataya na karo<br />
ae parindo dare zindaan se guzra na karo<br />
<br />
1. Jab se choota hai yatima se padar ka seena<br />
raat ko uthke kaha karti hai baba baba<br />
ab to dekha nahi jata hai tadapna iska<br />
kistarha mai ye kahu isse ke roya na karo<br />
<br />
2. Tum to azaad fazao ke musafir thehre<br />
shaam hote hi pohoch jaoge tum ghar apne<br />
dard kya samjoge tum log jila watno ke<br />
zakhm jo sukh gae hai unhe taaza na karo<br />
<br />
3. Asr e aashoor se rehti hai ye sehmi sehmi<br />
aaj tak bujh na saki tashna dahani iski<br />
kal thi shehzadi magar aaj hai ek faryadi<br />
ghumzada pehle se hai ghum me izafa na karo<br />
<br />
4. Badi mushkil se sulaya hai tasalli dekar<br />
jane kab hoga mayassar ise yasrab ka safar<br />
hoga ehsaan tumhara ye dile muztar par<br />
isko ehsaas aseeri ka dilaya na karo<br />
<br />
5. Qaid khane me thi shamshaad ye zainab ki fugha<br />
baap ki yaad me bechain sakina hai yahan<br />
iski ankho me hai pehle se hi ashre ka sama<br />
aur gardish me yatima ka sitara na karo<br />
